# Tunnel Monitor Folder Structure

Monorepo layout: **Private/**, **Public/**, **Universal/** at repo root. One SemVer per downloadable artifact.

## Category definitions

| Category | Path | Contents |
|----------|------|----------|
| **Private** | `Private/` | Mac Studio production; `Private/docs/` (operator docs, private wiki, repo mirror, cursor prompts); GUI in `Private/app/` |
| **Public** | `Public/` | Sanitized bundles; `Public/docs/`; GitHub wiki source in `Public/wiki/` |
| **Universal** | `Universal/` | Engine, adapters, scripts; v2 docs in `Universal/docs/v2/`; universal wiki in `Universal/docs/wiki/` |

## Docs and wiki placement

| Content | Path |
|---------|------|
| Operator topology, incidents, decision trees | `Private/docs/` (gitignored) |
| Private GitHub wiki pages | `Private/docs/wiki/` |
| Private docs repo mirror | `Private/docs/repo/` |
| Cursor build prompts | `Private/docs/cursor-prompt/` |
| Public operator docs | `Public/docs/` |
| Public GitHub wiki source | `Public/wiki/` |
| Universal v2 architecture docs | `Universal/docs/v2/` |
| Universal GitHub wiki source | `Universal/docs/wiki/` |

## Version folders

- Pattern: `NN-vMAJOR.MINOR.PATCH` (e.g. `01-v1.0.0`, `03-v2.0.0`)
- Location: `{Category}/builds/releases/NN-vX.Y.Z/`
- Index: `{Category}/datasets/bundle-manifest.json`
- Version file: `{Category}/VERSION` (SemVer core only)
- **Never** overwrite an existing release folder; increment sequence in manifest.

### Release folder contents (Private, Public GUI)

```
NN-vX.Y.Z/
├── bundle-manifest.json
├── CHECKSUMS.sha256
├── Tunnel Monitor.app/
└── Tunnel-Monitor-X.Y.Z.pkg
```

Universal `builds/releases/` is scaffold-only until a Universal GUI or core tarball ships.

## SemVer bump criteria

| Bump | When |
|------|------|
| **PATCH** | Backward-compatible bug fix; material bundled data correction |
| **MINOR** | Backward-compatible feature |
| **MAJOR** | Breaking change (schema, removed config, incompatible core contract) |

Bundled data (JSON, icons, `Assets.car`, embedded core pin): minimum **PATCH** + new `dataRevision` in category manifest.

## Build vs builds

- `{Category}/build/` — ephemeral staging (`build/dist/`); gitignored outputs
- `{Category}/builds/releases/` — immutable shipped artifacts

## Forbidden placements

- GUI Swift source outside `Private/app/` (Public copy only via `Public/mac/sync-app-from-private.sh`)
- Real IPs or operator topology in `Public/`
- `config.env` (non-template) in tracked files
- Legacy root paths after migration: `app/`, `vendor/`, `adapters/`, `scripts/`, `internal/`, root `install.sh`

## Allowed repo root

`Private/`, `Public/`, `Universal/`, `.github/`, `.cursor/`, plus meta files (`README.md`, `CHANGELOG.md`, `RELEASING.md`, `RELEASES.md`, `bundle-manifest.json`, `LICENSE`).

